  "changelog": "Initial release of goto-codedev-manager:\n\n- Unified scheduling layer supporting multiple IDEs and AI coding agents for code development, Git Diff analysis, and codebase tasks.\n- Connects Codex, Claude Code, QoerCN (Lingma), Trae, VS Code, Cursor, and Qoder for task delegation via CLI.\n- Supports EF Core entity recognition, migration generation, schema contract handoff, test/build execution, and reporting.\n- Provides strict permission levels: read-only auto execution, write actions with confirmation, and denial of dangerous operations.\n- Designed for .NET/EF Core tech stack as MVP, with future extensibility for other languages.\n- Includes prompt examples and clear configuration for adapters and workspaces.",
